> [6]: Archaeologists should have some sort of bonues against rolling
> boulder traps (Indiana Jones) --ilya86

   I'm surprised they don't already. (AFAICT, launch_item calls thitu,
which doesn't know where the boulder came from, so there can't currently
be any difference between trap-generated boulders and giant-thrown
boulders.)
   But just to make this more general, and add another tradeoff to the
game, I'd suggest that /any/ character class should get the bonus, if
they're wearing a fedora. (Thus, fedoras protect from rolling-boulder
traps but offer no protection against falling-rock traps. Tradeoff!)
Of course, nobody would still wear fedoras, so nobody would notice the
effect, but whatever.
   Maybe I'll patch this, if I ever get my copious free time back.

